<section class="gg-new-hero">
  <div class="gg-container gg-new-hero-grid">
    <div class="gg-new-hero-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower</span>
      <h1>Your goals deserve a place to grow.</h1>
      <p>
        Goal Grower turns habits and big goals into living plants, helping progress feel visual, calm, and worth returning to.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
        <a href="#experience" class="gg-btn-soft">Explore the App</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-new-phone-stage reveal">
      <div class="gg-ambient-card card-one">
        <strong>3</strong>
        <span>goals watered</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-ambient-card card-two">
        <strong>7</strong>
        <span>days returned</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-device main-device">
        <div class="gg-device-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-device-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-device side-device">
        <div class="gg-device-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-device-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '700x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower goals screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-belief-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-belief-card reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The idea</span>
      <h2>Progress should feel less like pressure and more like care.</h2>
      <p>
        Instead of cold streaks and empty checkboxes, Goal Grower gives your effort a visual life. You do not just complete tasks. You grow something.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-experience-section" id="experience">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">App experience</span>
      <h2>A simple loop that feels alive.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-experience-grid">
      <article class="gg-experience-card reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="gg-step-label">01</span>
          <h3>Create the goal</h3>
          <p>Choose what you want to grow and give it a clear reason to exist.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-mini-device">
          <div class="gg-device-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-device-screen">
            {{ 'gg-add-goal-saving-read-more-view.png' | asset_img_url: '800x' | img_tag: 'Add goal screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-experience-card reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="gg-step-label">02</span>
          <h3>Track the progress</h3>
          <p>See details, milestones, and the actions that keep your goal alive.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-mini-device">
          <div class="gg-device-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-device-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '800x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-experience-card reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="gg-step-label">03</span>
          <h3>Watch it grow</h3>
          <p>Your garden becomes a visual record of the life you are building.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-mini-device">
          <div class="gg-device-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-device-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '800x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-human-section">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Built for real life</span>
      <h2>For goals that need patience, not perfection.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-human-list reveal">
      <div>
        <strong>Imperfect days</strong>
        <span>Return without feeling like you failed everything.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Big goals and habits</strong>
        <span>Use one visual system for routines, projects, and long-term dreams.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Shared gardens</strong>
        <span>Grow with friends, family, classmates, or accountability partners.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-gallery-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Screenshots</span>
      <h2>See the garden take shape.</h2>
      <p>Real screens from the current Goal Grower beta.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-gallery-strip">
      <div class="gg-device gallery-device reveal">
        <div class="gg-device-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-device-screen">
          {{ 'gg-no-goals-yet.png' | asset_img_url: '800x' | img_tag: 'No goals yet screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-device gallery-device reveal">
        <div class="gg-device-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-device-screen">
          {{ 'gg-add-goal-saving-read-more-view.png' | asset_img_url: '800x' | img_tag: 'Add goal screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-device gallery-device reveal gallery-main">
        <div class="gg-device-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-device-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '800x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-device gallery-device reveal">
        <div class="gg-device-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-device-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '800x' | img_tag: 'Goals list screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-device gallery-device reveal">
        <div class="gg-device-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-device-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '800x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-shared-story-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-shared-story-card reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Shared gardens</span>
      <h2>Grow with people who are growing too.</h2>
      <p>
        Shared gardens let friends, spouses, classmates, roommates, and accountability partners work on their own goals while contributing to something together.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-shared-pills">
        <span>Friends</span>
        <span>Family</span>
        <span>Classmates</span>
        <span>Partners</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-roadmap-new">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Roadmap</span>
      <h2>Built in public. Growing over time.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-roadmap-line">
      <div class="gg-roadmap-node reveal">
        <span>Built</span>
        <strong>Goal tracking</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-roadmap-node reveal">
        <span>Built</span>
        <strong>Personal gardens</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-roadmap-node reveal">
        <span>Beta</span>
        <strong>Shared gardens</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-roadmap-node reveal">
        <span>Next</span>
        <strong>Android testing</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-roadmap-node reveal">
        <span>Future</span>
        <strong>Widgets</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-store-preview-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support</span>
      <h2>Support the app and future products.</h2>
      <p>The store helps fund development, testing, design, and intentional growth products.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-store-preview-grid">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-preview-card reveal">
        <span>Main</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower Support</h3>
        <p>Help fund the app while it grows.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-preview-card reveal">
        <span>Tools</span>
        <h3>Digital Products</h3>
        <p>Templates, planners, and intentional living tools.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-preview-card reveal">
        <span>Objects</span>
        <h3>Physical Products</h3>
        <p>Merch and calming productivity products.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-final-cta">
  <div class="gg-container reveal">
    <span class="gg-kicker">The mission</span>
    <h2>Build a life you can keep returning to.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is about making progress feel human, hopeful, and worth caring about.
    </p>
    <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
  </div>
</section>

